Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 22:07:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1272/3799] soh: rename func_80038A28 ->
 CollisionPoly_GetTransformMtx

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: its doc comment reads "Compute transform matrix mapping +y (up) to the collision poly's normal"; callers use it to stand actors and effects upright on a slope.
Defined in soh/src/code/z_bgcheck.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
